  "body_html": "<h1>natBinaryLoad_eq_add_of_true</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma natBinaryLoad_eq_add_of_true (w : I → Nat) {x : BinaryAllocation I} {i : I} (hxi : x i = true) : natBinaryLoad w x = w i + natBinaryLoad w (Function.update x i false)</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>BinaryAllocation</li>\n<li>natBinaryLoad</li>\n</ul>",
